        "desc": "NO-OP PLACEBO: an exact affine copy of the base's FIRST column (2.5*ref_mean + 7).  Its dR2 must be ~0 BY CONSTRUCTION because it is collinear with the base.  Its OBSERVED SD across draws is published as this screen's FLOOR OF RESOLUTION.  A placebo that is a genuine no-op tests nothing about perturbation, so s04 ALSO runs a PERTURBING placebo (G03) and verifies it moves the statistic."
